B 0xAEDF STAGE 7 RUNS ON A SCRIPT, AND EACH APPEARANCE FITS IN ONE WORD
B 0xAEDF The other stages release enemies in bursts; the seventh has them WRITTEN
B 0xAEDF one by one in the list at 0xAF3F, forty-three appearances in eighty-six
B 0xAEDF bytes. Each one is a single, tightly packed word: the low byte and bit 0
B 0xAEDF of the high byte are the distance (nine bits) at which it appears, bits 1
B 0xAEDF and 2 of the high byte are the variant, and the top five, the row. The
B 0xAEDF list is walked with a cursor at 0xE968 and ends at 0xFFFF.
