B 0xB010 THE OUT-OF-STEP BLINKING COMES FROM THE R REGISTER
B 0xB010 The six drawings of this enemy do not take turns at a fixed pace: every
B 0xB010 time it changes, bit 0 of the R register decides whether the next one
B 0xB010 lasts 0x0F frames or only 3. With the same table of six drawings, two
B 0xB010 enemies that come out at the same time are never in step.
