C 0xBAB3 And byte 20 shrinks the radius
C 0xBABA The same with the column difference
C 0xBAD9 Byte 2: every 0x3C frames...
C 0xBAE1 ...the radius loses a notch
L 0xBAEA turn_other_way   The same dance with the signs swapped
C 0xBAEA The row difference to the centre...
C 0xBAF0 ...divided by eight and with its sign swapped...
C 0xBAF8 ...is added to the column
C 0xBAFC And byte 20 shrinks the radius
