B 0xBBF1 THE THREE-SLOT ENEMY
B 0xBBF1 Type 0x1E is the only one that does not fit in one slot: it takes THREE
B 0xBBF1 in a row, and that is why p01:0x6A98 looks for them three at a time.
B 0xBBF1 Here the other two are set up with a single 0x40-byte `ldir` that
